    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/1",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Look out, Thak! It's a a Dang! Never can pronounce those things!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/5b7024f0e85c0137cedf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/0",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Got him, Byron! It's something in the Vespula genus, all right and ooooweeeee does he look mad!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/e49aaac0ea250137cfba005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/4",
    "published": "2026-11-12T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "Despite his repeated efforts to explain things to her, Satan could never dissuade his mother from offering cookies and milk to the accursed."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/3",
