    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/4",
    "published": "2026-11-11T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Let's see here. Oh! Close, but no cigar. You want the place up the road same as I told those other fellahs.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/0ca3ce20dccb0137caaf005056a9545d",
