  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/de4bfbc0cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/2",
    "published": "2026-11-11T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Don't be alarmed, folks he's completely harmless unless something startles him.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/390a53f0cdd50137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/1",
    "published": "2026-11-11T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"And, as you shall soon observe, we are quite proud of our test tube baby progress.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/11/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/d8a7c1e0e4790137cd9d005056a9545d",
