    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/4",
    "published": "2026-11-10T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "Suddenly, Professor Liebowitz realizes he has come to the seminar without his duck."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/3",
