    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/2",
    "published": "2026-11-10T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"You know, I have a confession to make, Bernie. Win or lose, I love doing this.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/e12c61f0d7400137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/1",
    "published": "2026-11-10T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"What a find, Williams! The fossilized footprint of a brachiosaurus! And a Homo habilus thrown in to boot!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/260ccd10df110137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/10/0",
    "published": "2026-11-10T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Auditions for the Lone Ranger's horse"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/d459a09002800138d7bb005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/4",
    "published": "2026-11-09T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Hey, Sid! Remember that time last summer we were all gathered around the kill like this, someone told a leopard joke, and you laughed so hard an antler came out your nose?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/7771e43002810138d7bb005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/3",
    "published": "2026-11-09T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-09-3"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/71cc3160e6f90137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/2",
    "published": "2026-11-09T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "The class was quietly doing its lesson when Russell, suffering from problems at home, prepared to employ an attention-getting device."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/f42845b0df0f0137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/1",
    "published": "2026-11-09T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Uh-oh did anyone remember to feed the giraffe tonight?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/7cfc26b0cdd30137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/09/0",
    "published": "2026-11-09T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"For twelve perfect years I was a car-chaser. Pontiacs, Fords, Chryslers I took 'em all on and yesterday my stupid owner backs over me in the driveway.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/08/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/0efd3c40dcc90137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/08/1",
    "published": "2026-11-08T12:01:00.000Z",
