  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/08/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/89cc9ec0e6f90137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/08/0",
    "published": "2026-11-08T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Buffalo, N.Y., Nov. 2-5: The annual convention of the Big Galoot Society of America"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/07/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/97b9d1d0e3ad0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/07/1",
    "published": "2026-11-07T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Nov. 12, 1957: Kevin Wakefield, during snack time, makes kindergarten history by selecting the soda cracker over the graham."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/07/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/165e3740d8ba0137c959005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/07/0",
    "published": "2026-11-07T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Okay! I'll talk! I'll talk! Take two sticks of approximately equal size and weight rub them together at opposing angles using short, brisk strokes \""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/80203400e92f0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/4",
    "published": "2026-11-06T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "Long before his rise to fame, artist Gus Nickerson experimented with many variations on a single theme until that fateful day when a friend said, \"Gus have you tried dogs playing poker?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/a6cab980d0ea0137c64d005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/3",
    "published": "2026-11-06T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"We're in trouble.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/003a8c50dcc90137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/2",
    "published": "2026-11-06T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Well, we might as well put it on board although I'm not sure what use we'll have for a box of rusty nails, broken glass, and throwing darts.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/f133de80d7410137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/1",
    "published": "2026-11-06T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I've had it, Doc! I've come all the way from Alabama with this danged thing on my knee!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/ca2aafd0e6f80137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/06/0",
    "published": "2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Okay, Jane, this guy you want me to go out with you say he lives alone, he doesn't have any friends, and he has a slight frothing problem. He's not a rogue, is he?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c38ab700df100137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/4",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "Appliance healers"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/0616a9f0e92e0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/3",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-05-3"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/321c9f40cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/2",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I told you guys to slow down and take it easy or something like this would happen.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/95b43b9258c311ea8bf6005056a9",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/1",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Just look at this room body segments everywhere!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/9c3707d0c1520137c0b4005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/0",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-05-0"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c9180b70df110137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/4",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-04-4"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/ee431a4a58c311ea8bf6005056a9",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/3",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Two, four, six, eight, who do we appreciate \""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c32136e0d7400137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/2",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Trim the bowl, you idiots! Trim the bowl!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/6f2b92d0e3ad0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/1",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-04-1"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/aecccee0e4860137cda5005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/0",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"We understand your concern, ma'am but this just isn't enough for us to go on. Now, you find the other half of your husband, and then we've got a case.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/80255140cdd20137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/4",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I told you to watch for bones.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/e4936750cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/3",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Well, well. The great hunter returneth.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/1ed7f700df110137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/2",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Just a word of warning, Myron if you miss, I'm comin' after your big hazel.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/5e4868c0e92f0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/1",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Now, moving on from the so-called funny bone, we come to this little guy and you tickle him at your own peril.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/8057a8d0e92d0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/0",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:00:00.000Z",
