  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/02/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/0a652650df120137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/02/3",
    "published": "2026-11-02T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "Early chemists describe the first dirt molecule."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/02/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/cae46420df100137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/02/2",
    "published": "2026-11-02T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Coincidence, ladies and gentlemen? Coincidence that my client just happened to live across from the A-1 Mask Co., just happened to walk by their office windows each day, and they, in turn, just happened to stumble across this new design?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/02/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/6f065d20fa850137d52f005056a9545d",
